WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Narrator: Whatever the incident, your steps are the same - and they often happen together.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.200
Narrator: Stay safe - don't go towards danger.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Narrator: Report to your supervisor, using the radio message you know.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.300
Narrator: Keep people back and keep a route clear for the emergency teams.

5
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Narrator: Follow the lead agency when an authorised instruction is within your role - confirm it, do it, and tell your supervisor.

6
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.200
Narrator: Then hand over: what you saw, what someone told you, and what you don't know yet.

7
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.700
Narrator: Check they've got it, and keep doing the tasks you still have.

8
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Narrator: If danger is right in front of you, warn and move people, and report at the earliest safe moment.

